WEBVTT

00:01:28.251 --> 00:01:31.921
all the assumptions that we inherit
from our surroundings

00:01:31.963 --> 00:01:33.673
and we don't often think about

00:01:33.714 --> 00:01:38.177
but which shape us deeply
in terms of how we think, live and act.

00:01:38.761 --> 00:01:42.306
And anthropologists do this
in two distinctive ways.

00:01:42.348 --> 00:01:45.852
Firstly, they believe in getting out
and getting our feet dirty

00:01:45.893 --> 00:01:49.605
and trying to participate
in people's lives to understand them.

00:01:49.981 --> 00:01:53.734
Which is why I'm wearing Tajik clothes
on the border of Tajikistan,

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:55.153
where I was living.

00:01:55.194 --> 00:01:56.404
But also,

00:01:56.445 --> 00:02:00.825
they believe in not just studying cultures
that we already know that are familiar